WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:00.990
Notebooks out —

2
00:00:01.390 --> 00:00:02.570
and they're staying out.

3
00:00:02.570 --> 00:00:05.280
Today's date at the top of a fresh page,

4
00:00:05.280 --> 00:00:06.690
then start your first note —

5
00:00:07.380 --> 00:00:09.390
just write a number one and go.

6
00:00:09.560 --> 00:00:12.510
Be honest with yourself: where are you actually starting

7
00:00:12.510 --> 00:00:13.545
from with AI —

8
00:00:13.545 --> 00:00:18.220
excited, skeptical, somewhere in between — and why?

9
00:00:18.540 --> 00:00:20.500
Then add one hope you have for it in

10
00:00:20.500 --> 00:00:22.160
your classroom, and one worry.

11
00:00:22.200 --> 00:00:23.570
Nobody's grading this.

12
00:00:24.060 --> 00:00:27.210
You'll write five numbered notes today, and your notebook

13
00:00:27.210 --> 00:00:29.730
is your workspace for the whole session —

14
00:00:29.800 --> 00:00:32.045
the typing comes at the end, and these notes

15
00:00:32.045 --> 00:00:33.040
will be your guide.
